<title>USA: FMC to begin unspecified stock repurchase.</title>
<headline>FMC to begin unspecified stock repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>FMC Corp said Thursday it will begin a stock repurchase of unspecified amount and duration to cover stock options that may be exercised during the year.</p>
<p>The amount of the buyback will depend on how many options are exercised, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
